      "clause_id": "CLAUSE-DOC026-1",
      "clause_number": "1",
      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 4151 : 2015) covers and specifies requirements for Protective Helmets for Motorcycle Riders - Specification (Fourth Revision). It applies to protective_helmets_motorcycle under personal_protective_equipment category in the mechanical_automotive domain.",
